{"seq":4,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成与 AST","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/code-generation","wordCount":784,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码生成与-ast\">代码生成与 AST</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Python 提供了强大的代码内省和生成能力。通过 <code>ast</code> 模块可以解析、分析和修改 Python 源码的抽象语法树；通过 <code>exec</code>/<code>eval</code> 可以动态执行代码；通过代码生成技术可以自动化重复的模板代码。这些能力是 linter、代码格式化工具和高级框架的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码生成能力围绕三种手段展开，各自的信任成本和适用边界截然不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>信任风险</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ast</code></td>\n<td>解析/分析/改写语法树，不执行代码</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>linter、代码审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模板 + <code>exec</code></td>\n<td>拼出源码后动态定义函数/类</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>生成重复的样板代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>eval</code> / <code>exec</code></td>\n<td>直接执行字符串代码</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>框架内部、REPL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>贯穿其中的一条安全主线是：<strong>AST 只是数据，执行才是效果</strong>。遍历和改写 AST 不会带来风险，而一旦把字符串交给 <code>eval</code>/<code>exec</code> 就等于执行任意代码——因此绝不要对用户输入直接调用它们，需要安全求值时用只支持字面量的 <code>ast.literal_eval</code>。</p>\n<p><code>inspect</code> 模块在运行时补齐了另一侧能力：反射获取签名、源码、成员，让&quot;生成代码&quot;前能先&quot;了解代码&quot;。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ast-基础\">AST 基础</h2><h3 id=\"解析源码为-ast\">解析源码为 AST</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import ast&#10;&#10;source = &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;def add(a: int, b: int) -&gt; int:&#10;    return a + b&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;tree = ast.parse(source)&#10;print(ast.dump(tree, indent=2))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ast</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">def add(a: int, b: int) -> int:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    return a + b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ast.parse(source)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ast.dump(tree, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">indent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ast-节点层次\">AST 节点层次</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Module --&gt; FunctionDef&#10;  FunctionDef --&gt; arguments&#10;  FunctionDef --&gt; Return&#10;  arguments --&gt; arg_a[arg: a]&#10;  arguments --&gt; arg_b[arg: b]&#10;  Return --&gt; BinOp&#10;  BinOp --&gt; Name_a[Name: a]&#10;  BinOp --&gt; Add&#10;  BinOp --&gt; Name_b[Name: b]\">graph TD\n  Module --&gt; FunctionDef\n  FunctionDef --&gt; arguments\n  FunctionDef --&gt; Return\n  arguments --&gt; arg_a[arg: a]\n  arguments --&gt; arg_b[arg: b]\n  Return --&gt; BinOp\n  BinOp --&gt; Name_a[Name: a]\n  BinOp --&gt; Add\n  BinOp --&gt; Name_b[Name: b]</pre><h3 id=\"常见-ast-节点类型\">常见 AST 节点类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>对应语法</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Module</code></td>\n<td>模块</td>\n<td>整个 .py 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FunctionDef</code></td>\n<td>函数定义</td>\n<td><code>def foo(): ...</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ClassDef</code></td>\n<td>类定义</td>\n<td><code>class Bar: ...</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Assign</code></td>\n<td>赋值语句</td>\n<td><code>x = 1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Return</code></td>\n<td>返回语句</td>\n<td><code>return x + y</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Call</code></td>\n<td>函数调用</td>\n<td><code>foo(1, 2)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BinOp</code></td>\n<td>二元运算</td>\n<td><code>a + b</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>If</code></td>\n<td>条件语句</td>\n<td><code>if x &gt; 0: ...</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ast-遍历与分析\">AST 遍历与分析</h2><h3 id=\"nodevisitor-模式\">NodeVisitor 模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import ast&#10;&#10;class FunctionCounter(ast.NodeVisitor):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.count = 0&#10;&#10;    def visit_FunctionDef(self, node: ast.FunctionDef):&#10;        self.count += 1&#10;        print(f&quot;Found function: {node.name} at line {node.lineno}&quot;)&#10;        self.generic_visit(node)&#10;&#10;with open(&quot;example.py&quot;) as f:&#10;    tree = ast.parse(f.read())&#10;&#10;counter = FunctionCounter()&#10;counter.visit(tree)&#10;print(f&quot;Total functions: {counter.count}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ast</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FunctionCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NodeVisitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> visit_FunctionDef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node: ast.FunctionDef):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Found function: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node.name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> at line </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node.lineno</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.generic_visit(node)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"example.py\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ast.parse(f.read())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FunctionCounter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter.visit(tree)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Total functions: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter.count</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实用分析示例\">实用分析示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ImportAnalyzer(ast.NodeVisitor):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.imports: list[str] = []&#10;&#10;    def visit_Import(self, node: ast.Import):&#10;        for alias in node.names:&#10;            self.imports.append(alias.name)&#10;&#10;    def visit_ImportFrom(self, node: ast.ImportFrom):&#10;        self.imports.append(f&quot;from {node.module}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImportAnalyzer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NodeVisitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.imports: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> visit_Import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node: ast.Import):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alias </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.names:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.imports.append(alias.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> visit_ImportFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node: ast.ImportFrom):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.imports.append(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"from </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node.module</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ast-转换\">AST 转换</h2><h3 id=\"nodetransformer-模式\">NodeTransformer 模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class DebugTransformer(ast.NodeTransformer):&#10;    def visit_FunctionDef(self, node: ast.FunctionDef):&#10;        debug_print = ast.parse(&#10;            f&#39;print(&quot;Entering {node.name}&quot;)&#39;&#10;        ).body[0]&#10;        node.body.insert(0, debug_print)&#10;        ast.fix_missing_locations(node)&#10;        return self.generic_visit(node)&#10;&#10;source = &quot;def g