=\"import inspect&#10;&#10;def analyze_function(func):&#10;    sig = inspect.signature(func)&#10;    for name, param in sig.parameters.items():&#10;        print(f&quot;{name}: {param.annotation}, default={param.default}&quot;)&#10;&#10;    source = inspect.getsource(func)&#10;    print(f&quot;Source lines: {len(source.splitlines())}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inspect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyze_function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(func):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inspect.signature(func)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name, param </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sig.parameters.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">param.annotation</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, default=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">param.default</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inspect.getsource(func)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Source lines: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(source.splitlines())</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>inspect.signature()</code></td>\n<td>获取函数签名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inspect.getsource()</code></td>\n<td>获取源代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inspect.getmembers()</code></td>\n<td>获取对象所有成员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inspect.isclass()</code></td>\n<td>判断是否是类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inspect.stack()</code></td>\n<td>获取调用栈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>AST 分析适用于 linter、代码审查工具、自动文档生成</li>\n<li>避免在生产代码中使用 <code>exec</code>/<code>eval</code>，它们是安全隐患</li>\n<li>需要安全求值时使用 <code>ast.literal_eval</code></li>\n<li>代码生成优先使用 <code>dataclasses</code> / <code>attrs</code> 等成熟方案</li>\n<li>使用 <code>ast.fix_missing_locations()</code> 确保转换后的 AST 可编译</li>\n<li>复杂的 AST 操作考虑使用 <code>libcst</code>（保留格式的 CST 库）</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代码生成有三种手段：<code>ast</code>（改写语法树）、模板 + <code>exec</code>（生成源码）、<code>eval</code> / <code>exec</code>（执行字符串），信任成本依次升高。</li>\n<li>AST 只是数据，执行才有效果：遍历、改写安全，<code>eval</code> / <code>exec</code> 等于执行任意代码。</li>\n<li><code>NodeVisitor</code> 用于遍历分析，<code>NodeTransformer</code> 用于改写，改写后须 <code>ast.fix_missing_locations()</code>。</li>\n<li>绝不对用户输入调用 <code>eval</code> / <code>exec</code>；安全求值用 <code>ast.literal_eval</code>。</li>\n<li>代码生成优先使用 <code>dataclasses</code> / <code>attrs</code> 等成熟方案，复杂 AST 操作考虑 <code>libcst</code>。</li>\n<li><code>inspect</code> 在运行时反射签名、源码与成员，是生成代码前的探测工具。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码生成与 AST","id":"代码生成与-ast"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AST 基础","id":"ast-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"解析源码为 AST","id":"解析源码为-ast"},{"level":3,"text":"AST 节点层次","id":"ast-节点层次"},{"level":3,"text":"常见 AST 节点类型","id":"常见-ast-节点类型"},{"level":2,"text":"AST 遍历与分析","id":"ast-遍历与分析"},{"level":3,"text":"NodeVisitor 模式","id":"nodevisitor-模式"},{"level":3,"text":"实用分析示例","id":"实用分析示例"},{"level":2,"text":"AST 转换","id":"ast-转换"},{"level":3,"text":"NodeTransformer 模式","id":"nodetransformer-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"exec 与 eval","id":"exec-与-eval"},{"level":3,"text":"安全性注意事项","id":"安全性注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"代码生成实战","id":"代码生成实战"},{"level":3,"text":"自动生成 `__init__` 方法","id":"自动生成-__init__-方法"},{"level":3,"text":"基于模板的代码生成","id":"基于模板的代码生成"},{"level":2,"text":"inspect 模块","id":"inspect-模块"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"元类与类工厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/metaclasses"},"next":{"title":"NumPy 与向量化计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/numpy"}}